---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms and Conditions | McCullough Clark"
  description="Terms and conditions for McCullough Clark services and the McCullough Clark client text messaging program."
  ogTitle="Terms and Conditions | McCullough Clark"
  ogDescription="Terms and conditions for McCullough Clark services and text messaging program."
  ogUrl="https://mcculloughclark.com/terms/"
>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-[720px] reveal">
        <p class="text-[13px] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-gray mb-6">Last updated August 25, 2026</p>
        <h1 class="text-[40px] md:text-[64px] font-medium tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[1.1] mb-10">Terms and Conditions</h1>

        <p class="text-secondary mb-5">These terms apply to your use of the McCullough Clark website and client communications. Bookkeeping and advisory services are governed by the engagement agreement between McCullough Clark and each client. If anything here conflicts with your engagement agreement, the engagement agreement controls.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium leading-[1.3] mt-12 mb-3">Website use</h2>
        <p class="text-secondary mb-5">Content on this site is provided for general information and is not accounting, tax, or legal advice for your specific situation. Advice is provided only within an active client engagement.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium leading-[1.3] mt-12 mb-3">Text messaging program</h2>
        <p class="text-secondary mb-5">The McCullough Clark client notifications program sends account-related text messages to clients who opt in, including monthly review reminders, document requests, and replies to client questions. The program is operated by Bloom Bookkeeping Services, LLC dba McCullough Clark.</p>
        <p class="text-secondary mb-5"><strong>Opting in.</strong> You opt in by providing your mobile number to McCullough Clark and agreeing to receive account-related texts. Consent is not a condition of receiving services.</p>
        <p class="text-secondary mb-5"><strong>Message frequency.</strong> Message frequency varies with account activity. Most clients receive a few messages per month.</p>
        <p class="text-secondary mb-5"><strong>Message and data rates may apply.</strong> Your mobile carrier's standard message and data rates apply to messages you send and receive. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>
        <p class="text-secondary mb-5"><strong>Opting out.</strong> Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message to stop receiving texts. After you reply STOP, we will send one final message confirming you have been unsubscribed. Reply START to resume messages at any time.</p>
        <p class="text-secondary mb-5"><strong>Help and support.</strong> Reply <strong>HELP</strong> to any message for assistance, or contact <a href="mailto:sharla@mcculloughclark.com" class="underline underline-offset-[3px]">sharla@mcculloughclark.com</a>.</p>
        <p class="text-secondary mb-5">For details on how mobile numbers and messaging consent are handled, see our <a href="/privacy/" class="underline underline-offset-[3px]">Privacy Policy</a>. Mobile information is never shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium leading-[1.3] mt-12 mb-3">Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-secondary mb-5">Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:sharla@mcculloughclark.com" class="underline underline-offset-[3px]">sharla@mcculloughclark.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
